{"login": "juanfuooo", "location": "Antarctica", "commits": [{"sha": "2b607e60ed61fb62ade2e596d5a591807e180744", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-03-19T10:19:25Z", "repo": "The-relationship-between-La-nina-and-MJO-Summer-project-in-Uni-Melb", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb87afb78e746b629ebf7dd587563887a84de750", "message": "Updates on the Bayesian tuning and lookup table method\n\nHere are some issues require to notice:\n1. After the Bayesian tuning, the best hyperparameter combination actually has a high RMSE than our default setting. My guess is that during Bayesian tuning, 4 fold cross validation was also applied and in order to prevent overfitting, the hyperparameter was set to be more conservative.\n2. With NaN values in high dimensional data, the dimension order in averaging will cause the results different.", "created_at": "2025-02-25T04:29:08Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b8e44c58fb1be90e65ce4520cdc9eb41dd874175", "message": "Applied the preliminary attempt of the Bayesian optimal method", "created_at": "2025-02-19T21:16:45Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c54d454cd6725372a66c0b61e2abb4c0bf06e77e", "message": "XGBoost model tuning and lookup table setup\n\nIn this commit, I used the one-by-one tuning method, and the performance decreased. Next time, I will use the grid search method which tunes all the hyperparameters simultaneously. This will significantly increase the computational demand but worth trying.", "created_at": "2025-02-10T21:11:18Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97c97804f58274c02fc9a55c2470c52c19fdae49", "message": "Update the Readme file in step 2", "created_at": "2025-01-28T22:30:02Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f2398e704fb9362a45b1fcd7d2c0c1f2f1531c7", "message": "Running XGBoost Model on NCI GPU instance\n\nWe successfully run the XGBoost model on NCI GPU instance. In order to to use the GPU on NCI, instead of using the Climate CMS Conda environment, we have to set up our own environment on NCI and install all the required packages.", "created_at": "2025-01-28T22:12:27Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1eb5b6524724a22d9e75c241b0303ac31e25aebb", "message": "xgb_development", "created_at": "2025-01-17T08:37:56Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db3882a7bc99c0df843880a665c0ecad485f863b", "message": "xgb_initial_setup", "created_at": "2025-01-17T02:10:50Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ffcbff8f612edd0066e44f3e0f45f56d5c28132", "message": "Argo_interpolation_fixing", "created_at": "2025-01-16T10:08:22Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a23cfde0177a4d4f5188ef6e00cb770560e2f2ca", "message": "oisst_update", "created_at": "2025-01-16T02:05:59Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "44ab539270d24e2e4b5ee4b2901b18568ed4f788", "message": "oisst", "created_at": "2025-01-13T09:57:06Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "df61a53932430794d71633c5816b3600990a1ed9", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/juanfuooo/Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "created_at": "2025-01-13T02:44:26Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0553664cd15c24aacf3cc12de9e982a4864100f6", "message": "Argo_interpolation", "created_at": "2025-01-13T02:43:58Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "688d1435073848d31362e64f5ca326362a608b08", "message": "Update LICENSE", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:48:00Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "066ef80fb081103f76edbdd4f776ee1ff3c7eef6", "message": "Initial Part of Step 1", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:42:28Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "67348299731375b1e4e73d142c7f376776ea0c35", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2024-12-28T09:07:25Z", "repo": "Subtropical-Front-Modeling-Code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e304c4558649284bd6e14bd087a525cefb73f35a", "message": "Integrate and plot the MJO and LPM events to the ERA5 Total Precipitation data", "created_at": "2025-06-02T07:34:08Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9e26d3d16f08d0ce25aa78925475285d80b67b2b", "message": "The hovemoller analysis and other analysis\n\nMade some analysis on the moisture budget terms in our interesting area.", "created_at": "2025-05-05T05:31:01Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c97c6a9353c6a82f6187d163f77b93ee3374c86", "message": "NCI_workflow\n\nI tried to set up to XGBoost model to understand the driven factors that influence rainfall in the Great Barrier Reef area (140-170E, 15-20S, 1998-2022). The moisture budget model used ERA5 data: mer, vimfc, vi_qtend and it can explain over 80% of the variability in the total precipitation. However, the simplify model, which used u850, v850, q850, and SST, can only explain around 30% of precipitation variability.", "created_at": "2025-04-27T04:11:58Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a3dbed1bd84eb9f699e2502aa4822b62be89a430", "message": "Week3 updates", "created_at": "2025-04-02T11:43:10Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d5b95aad42ef6a0fbd2ac698ccdb33ed264958cf", "message": "Week03 analysis", "created_at": "2025-04-02T04:03:37Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5cbe6e9bbfa9f97e0d55490a6479e8b0bdd74778", "message": "Hovm\u00f6ller diagram", "created_at": "2025-03-27T13:23:27Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7c6d6f488938544ce005c95d70562c7a4b2ca278", "message": "The tropical, subtropical and extratropical precipitation sst analysis\n\nas described", "created_at": "2025-03-27T11:37:24Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4c041103ba8e53a05b0d1484851627a963bdd189", "message": "The spatial temporal averaged precipitation against sst plot\n\nThree boxes (15S -18S) (146E-149E; 152E-155E; 157E-160E) are chosen.\nSum the precipitation in 1 degT sst intervel and then divided by the observations to get the mathematical expectation. Then plot it on the sst interval and make linear regression.\nWe found that at all the three boxes (from costal area to ocean) precipitation has positive correlation with sst (statistically significant), which is aligned with others' research.", "created_at": "2025-03-24T07:56:22Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8b0a75958bc959297364199703d8a519267fcdfb", "message": "Preliminary analysis on the SST-Precipitation R^2", "created_at": "2025-03-20T00:15:00Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "741f899c835d9432fd122150cc18432c6f55400d", "message": "data_preparation", "created_at": "2025-03-17T05:29:15Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ec2d027818b4f4ee30bc931af5a8de471f01790", "message": "Delete matlab.mat", "created_at": "2025-03-15T06:30:42Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8b4d08e58ac02e3e8c8d2fdb0d4c47021a496267", "message": "TRMM data merging and check", "created_at": "2025-03-15T06:29:37Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "72bccfbd5c130a8cb7b9c2dbcf23ff04f8c1b1d7", "message": "Create .gitignore", "created_at": "2025-03-11T03:33:30Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "584de791adb01059e048bb8910e8e9295025d143", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-03-11T03:31:03Z", "repo": "Local_Remote_Influences_on_Coastal_Rainfall", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}